    "code": "LABEL_ERROR",
    "text": "The 'derived play-type possession records' are based on inferred labels, which were identified in previous work (RES:APPA-005) as potentially suffering from label noise ('near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise'). This directly impacts the reliability of the H2-H1 change measurement."
