   "code": "CONFOUNDING",
   "text": "It is difficult to isolate whether an observed H2-H1 change in an opponent's offensive performance (e.g., PPP, play-type mix) is solely due to the defensive team's adjustment or strategy, versus the offensive team's own adjustments, fatigue, or random variance. This was a primary reason for the 'untestable' verdict in prior, related research."
